{start_of_verse: Intro}
[C]Old and in the [D]way, that’s [G]what I heard them [C]say
They [Am]used to heed the [C]words he said, but that was [G]yesterday
[C]Gold will turn to [D]gray and [G]youth will fade [C]away
They’ll [Am]never care [C]about you while you’re old and in the [G]way
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[D]Once I hear tell, he was [G]happy
